OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader to call for closer
OL,4,Aunionist co-operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut such calls have fallen on deaf ears
OL,7,Fbefore and with the DUP apparently
OL,8,Fweakened there is no guarantee that
OL,9,Fwon't be the case again.
